sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as Assessment Service
    participant C as Code Execution Service
    participant J as Judge0
    participant VM as Firecracker microVM
    participant E as Evaluation Service

    F->>A: Submit Code (Submission)
    A->>C: ExecutionRequested Event/API
    C->>J: Enqueue Execution Job (Resource Limits)
    J->>VM: Spawn MicroVM & Execute
    VM-->>J: Execution Result / Timeout
    J-->>C: Result Collection
    C->>A: ExecutionCompleted Event
    C->>E: Send Execution Result
    E->>E: AI-based Code Evaluation
    E->>A: EvaluationCompleted Event
    A-->>F: Return Evaluation & Result
